  "sourceScope": "Union of portable proof, SQLite and diagnostic room Worker bundle inputs, changed/new implementation and documents, and toolchain/deployment inputs. Required check, three-runtime replay, fifteen SQLite cold-process boundaries and the local keyboard inspector pass. Rebuilt portable/SQLite source and bundle hashes and the final inspector client match their passed reports. All three automatic four-browser attempts failed and did not capture source/bundle hashes; their retained timing/room/client evidence does not establish network acceptance. Initial assertion, timeout and verifier integration failures precede documented corrections. No deployed service or final-media acceptance.",
